  "question": {
    "text": "A closed organ pipe and an open pipe of the same length produce <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math> beats when they are set into vibrations simultaneously. If the length of each of them were twice their initial lengths, then find the number of beats produced.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><msub><mrow><mi>&#957;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>&#957;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>&#957;</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>&#957;</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfrac><mi>V</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>V</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>L</mi></math></p><p><br />Now in <math><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></msup></math> case:-<br /><math><mi>&#957;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>&#8242;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi>&#957;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>&#8242;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#957;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>&#8242;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>&#957;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>&#8242;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>",
